  "sourceTitle": "Apple Cinnamon and Walnut Oatmeal Bake",
  "sourceText": "Apple Cinnamon and Walnut Oatmeal Bake\nBy: danny\nPublished: Friday, February 4, 2011 - 7:09am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups quick oats\n1/2 cup ground flax seeds (optional)\n2 eggs\n1 cup milk\n1 teaspoon baking powder\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1/4 cup walnuts\n1 whole apple, diced\n1/2 cup brown sugar\n1/4 cup golden raisins\n1 1/2 cups applesauce\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n2 teaspoons cinnamon\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients in a bowl. pour into a well greased baking dish. bake at 350º for 40-45 min. garnish with apples and walnuts",
